    "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2019 the Syndicate's gross claims outstanding at the opening of the year were $2,734.141m. The technical provisions note shows a gross prior-year movement (over/under-provision in respect of prior claims) of $156.605m (gross strengthening). This gross strengthening reflects adverse development on prior large property and reinsurance losses (notably hurricanes and related catastrophe events from 2017-2018), partly offset at the reinsurer level (reinsurers' share shows a larger release) such that the net movement was a release. The development primarily affected the Syndicate's reinsurance and property portfolios.",
    "raw_causal_phrases": [
      "Over/under-provision in respect of prior claims and claim adjustment expenses",
      "The 2017 account picked up almost all of the reinsurance loss from the 2017 hurricanes (Harvey, Irma, Maria) together with a share of direct property loss.",
      "The 2018 account will pick up almost all of the reinsurance loss from the 2018 hurricanes (Florence, Michael), typhoons (Jebi, Trami) and Californian wildfire losses together with a share of the direct property loss from these events.",
      "There was a release of $23.1 million from the closed years of 2016 and prior"
